# FDS - Fysh Derived Security

FDS is a fork of EDS Lite by Sovworks.

  Upstream:  https://github.com/sovworks/edslite
  Forked at: 8a0c0d3 "Updated source code to v2.0.0.237 (bug fixing)", 2020-04-21
  Upstream licence: GPL-2.0-or-later ("GPLv2+", per upstream README.MD)

Upstream's "or any later version" grant permits distributing this derivative work
under GPL-3.0, which is what FDS does. The original GPL-2.0 text is preserved in
LICENSE.upstream-GPL-2.0 for provenance; LICENSE is the GPL-3.0 text that governs
this fork.

Note that the grant reaches later versions of *the GPL* only. AGPL-3.0 is a
separate licence, not a later version of the GPL, so FDS cannot be relicensed to
AGPL-3.0 even though the rest of the Fysh estate is AGPL-3.0. GPLv3 section 13
permits combining GPL-3.0 and AGPL-3.0 code, but that is linking, not
relicensing.

